# Signova scaffold — documentation placeholder; no implementation.
# Purpose: Describe future public API/WS base URL settings without assigning or storing secrets.
# Owner: Adham.
# Expected inputs: Ali exact local origins and public /api/v1 base paths.
# Expected outputs: Comment-only example guidance for later owner configuration.
# Responsibilities: Explain VITE_API_BASE_URL and VITE_WS_BASE_URL and that browser settings are
#   public.
# Connections: REST client, liveSocket, Vite and local development runbook.
# Future implementation: Later use VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1 and
#   VITE_WS_BASE_URL=ws://localhost:8000/api/v1 after setup is assigned.
# Rules and limitations: No active assignments, real capability tokens, model credentials or
#   private backend keys.
# Expected tests or acceptance: Example contains no secrets; later production URLs use HTTPS/wss
#   and preserve the /api/v1 prefix.
